    "q-34901": {
      "dom_id": "step-q34901",
      "name": "Question 1",
      "problem": "If $A$ is a $7\\times 11$ matrix that has $7$ **non-pivot** columns, then $\\text{dim(Null}(A))=$",
      "worked_solution": "We know that $\\text{dim(Null}(A))$ is the number of non-pivot columns in $A.$\n\nSince we are told that $A$ has $7$ non-pivot columns, we have \n\n$$\n\\text{dim(Null}(A))=7.\n$$",
